Dear Iris,

Notice is given of the Annual General Meeting of the Caldermere Trustees Association on Thursday 11 December at 6.30pm, Quay Rooms (boiler permitting; otherwise the Sailing Club).

Gideon is standing down as Chair after six years. Nominations for Chair, with a proposer and seconder, must reach me in writing by Friday 27 November, the constitution requiring fourteen days' notice. Reply to this email or post to the Association's address.

Formal papers follow at the end of November.

Beatrix Oyelaran
Hon. Secretary, Caldermere Trustees Association
